      "title": "How to reset error E21 on the Contoso Volt display",
      "content": "<h2>Reset E21</h2><p>Switch the bike off, remove the battery for sixty seconds, refit it and hold the mode button for five seconds. If E21 returns, update to firmware 3.3 from a service point.</p>",
